<title>JAPAN: Canon Inc up on bellwether buying.</title>
<headline>Canon Inc up on bellwether buying.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canon Inc shares rose on Thursday morning in trade on the Tokyo stock market, lifted by investors hunting for laggard bellwether issues, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0155 GMT the shares were up 60 yen at 2,430 yen, on trade of 4.16 million shares, the second most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
